          {Cell["9. Required consistency checks", "Section", 
            ExpressionUUID -> "4e1f715f-8d52-436f-a2de-18dac18a8919"], 
           Cell["Check A: setting jrot -> 0 must reproduce the static \
three-charge STU source. Check B: the curvature-free vector invariant must \
remain zero on the rotating BPS background. Check C: q1 -> q2 must agree with \
the C112 truncation. Check D: q1 -> q2 -> q3 must reduce to the \
minimal-supergravity BMPV sector. Check E: the final solution must be \
asymptotically flat and regular at the horizon after fixing physical charges \
and angular momentum.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "c7815732-9338-44f2-97d8-97b118196f2c"], 
           Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"staticLimitRules", "=", 
                 RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"jrot", "\[Rule]", "0"}], "}"}]}], ";", 
               RowBox[{"twoEqualChargeRules", "=", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                    {"q2", "\[Rule]", "q1"}], "}"}]}], ";", RowBox[
                {"equalChargeRules", "=", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                    {RowBox[{"q2", "\[Rule]", "q1"}], ",", RowBox[{"q3", 
                       "\[Rule]", "q1"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}]], "Input", 
            InitializationCell -> False, CellLabel -> "In[43]:=", 
            ExpressionUUID -> "5a7db1a7-e778-46b8-84b0-ee874aca03fa"]}, 
          Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["10. Notes on interpretation", 
            "Section", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "edbc1491-08e6-4bb2-b7fc-e8cfe7437d9e"], Cell["A vanishing \
curvature-free vector invariant does not permit deleting the F^4 monomials \
that belong to the supersymmetric Riemann/Weyl-squared gravity invariant. The \
latter must be varied as one complete package. The present notebook therefore \
retains all Riemann-F^2, quartic field-strength, scalar-gradient, and mixed \
Chern-Simons completion terms.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "19aaad09-dae8-4cfc-9a91-fc1cd9c00831"], 
           Cell["For publication-quality confidence, compare the reduced \
equations with at least a subset of covariant field equations. Symmetry \
reduction is efficient, but a covariant check guards against equations in \
non-singlet sectors that are absent from the reduced action.", "Text", 
            ExpressionUUID -> "6dc0ddc3-dd7a-4be8-8c40-8bc9e54be542"], 
           Cell["End of generated notebook", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "d5567d56-d495-4db2-98f4-9ead767fc574"]}, Open]], 
        Cell[CellGroupData[
          {Cell["10. Executable stage ledger and evidence boundary", 
            "Section", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "3b3321db-4771-49ab-80ac-d0d5cd345a0e"], Cell["The cells above \
construct the geometry, action densities, invariant coefficients, and \
Euler-Lagrange operators. They do not execute the full four-derivative \
variation for all thirteen fields by default. That downstream equation \
archive is notebook 01; a true substitution verifier is notebook 12.", 
            "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "3cf07410-bb55-4350-80d5-1680fabb3ebd"], 
           Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[
                   {"lightGeometryStagePass", "=", RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
